  <office:body>
    <office:text>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">桃園市平鎮區公所申請－低收入戶及中低收入戶－中低收入老人生活津貼－身心障礙者生活補助－兒童及少年生活扶助 調查表</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Small">一年度 ■新申請 微型保險被保險人＿＿；受益人＿＿身分證字號＿＿，與被保險人關係＿＿申請人簽章＿＿</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Small">□複查 □本案同意維持原被保險人及受益人 □本案需更換被保險人及受益人(需另填切結書) □本案自願放棄加保權益</text:p>
      <text:p>申請日期：＿＿年＿＿月＿＿日；文件備齊日期：＿＿年＿＿月＿＿日；補件日期：第1次＿＿年＿＿月＿＿日；第2次＿＿年＿＿月＿＿日</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Head">壹、基本資料</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="基本資料" table:style-name="Grid">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col" table:number-columns-repeated="4" table:default-cell-style-name="Cell"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>申請人姓名：＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>連絡電話：＿＿＿＿</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>行動電話：＿＿＿＿</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>戶籍地址：＿＿＿里＿＿＿鄰＿＿＿＿路(街、新村)＿＿段＿＿巷＿＿弄＿＿街＿＿＿號＿＿樓之＿＿ 聯絡地址：＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>居住狀況：□自有住宅 □租賃(每月租金＿＿＿元) 機構安置 □自費 □公費＿＿□醫療院所＿＿＿＿ □其他＿＿＿＿</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>□借住(□直系親屬 □非直系親屬 □朋友，房屋所有人姓名：＿＿＿＿、國民身分證統編：＿＿＿＿＿＿、電話：＿＿＿＿＿＿)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>身　份：□一般 □平地原住民　□山地原住民　□榮民(領取院外就養金□是，領取＿＿元□否) □其他地區移民 □其他＿＿＿</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>□是　□否　單親家庭（育有18歲以下子女）　　□是　□否　有外籍配偶</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p text:style-name="Head">貳、全家人口及收入狀況：(請依據國稅局、稅捐稽徵單位提供財稅資料及實際調查資料填寫)</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="全家人口及收入狀況" table:style-name="Grid">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col" table:number-columns-repeated="14" table:default-cell-style-name="Cell"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell><text:p>□號</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>不計人口</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>身份</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>列冊(申領者)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>稱謂</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>姓名</text:p><text:p>身分證字號</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>出生</text:p><text:p>年 月 日</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>足歲</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>婚姻</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>職業</text:p><text:p>無(原因)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>健康</text:p><text:p>有(請註明) 疾病 障礙等級</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>收入項目（每月）單位：新台幣元</text:p><text:p>工作收入　利息收入　退休俸、外就養金　其他收入　其他津貼　小計</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>動產（一年）現金、存款本金、有價證券、股票、投資之合計</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>不動產 全家人口之土地、房屋合計 郵政劃撥局帳號</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell><text:p>1</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell><text:p>本人</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell><text:p>□已婚 □未婚 □離婚 □喪偶</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell><text:p>房</text:p><text:p>土</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell><text:p>2</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell><text:p>□已婚 □未婚 □離婚 □喪偶</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell><text:p>房</text:p><text:p>土</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell><text:p>3</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell><text:p>□已婚 □未婚 □離婚 □喪偶</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell><text:p>房</text:p><text:p>土</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell><text:p>4</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell><text:p>□已婚 □未婚 □離婚 □喪偶</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell><text:p>房</text:p><text:p>土</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell><text:p>5</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell><text:p>□已婚 □未婚 □離婚 □喪偶</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell><text:p>房</text:p><text:p>土</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell><text:p>6</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell><text:p>□已婚 □未婚 □離婚 □喪偶</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell><text:p>房</text:p><text:p>土</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell><text:p>7</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell><text:p>□已婚 □未婚 □離婚 □喪偶</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell><text:p>房</text:p><text:p>土</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p>(人口欄位不足時，請在此浮貼)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>小計</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p text:style-name="Head">參、核計結果</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="核計結果" table:style-name="Grid">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col" table:number-columns-repeated="2" table:default-cell-style-name="Cell"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell><text:p>審核項目</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>審核結果</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell><text:p>全家人口數/有工作能力人數</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>全家　人/能力　人</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell><text:p>全家每月總收入/平均每人每月收入</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>　/　元</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell><text:p>全家人口存款利息(年)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>　元</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
